/*--------------------------------*- Choupo -*-----------------------*\
  Membrane (CASE-LOCAL): Toray TM720C brackish-water membrane, water
  permeance ONLY -- the transport record behind TM720C-430.dat.

  A_w is NOT stated by the case study: DERIVED here so that the element
  delivers the document's 33.3 m3/d at the assumed standard brackish test of
  TM720C-430.dat (2,000 ppm NaCl, 1.03 MPa, 25 C, 15 % recovery), by running
  the module at that test (`[ratedTest]` prints the engine's permeate beside
  the sheet's) and moving A_w until they agree.  A calibration to the
  manufacturer's claim, origin `assumed`.
\*---------------------------------------------------------------------------*/

name           TM720C;
kind           RO;
manufacturer   "Toray";

A_w            1.204e-6  m/s/bar;     // DERIVED, see header
